WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.741
Hisaab ma tamaru swaagat chhe.

00:00:02.761 --> 00:00:09.583
Ema Accounts, stock, GST, TDS ane payroll,
Bharat na vepaar maate.

00:00:10.283 --> 00:00:14.356
Tamara chopda tamara potana computer par rahe
chhe.

00:00:14.376 --> 00:00:17.358
Amari sathe koi account ni jarur nathi.

00:00:17.378 --> 00:00:19.134
Ane Hisaab free chhe.

00:00:19.934 --> 00:00:27.232
Tame Tally jaano chho, to Hisaab pan jaano
chho: e j Gateway, e j keys, e j reports.

00:00:27.262 --> 00:00:30.288
Alt+K haju pan Company menu chhe.

00:00:31.452 --> 00:00:37.027
GST invoice, print, PDF, e-mail ke WhatsApp
par.

00:00:38.107 --> 00:00:44.178
Ane tamari company Tally mathi aave chhe,
darek balance match thay ena proof sathe.

00:00:45.158 --> 00:00:53.217
Aa video ma das nana chapter chhe. Kram ma
juo, ke tamne joie te chapter par jao.

00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:59.626
Chapter 3: Switch from Tally, darek balance
match thay ena proof sathe.

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:07.422
Pehla, fakt ek vaar TallyPrime ma: eno XML
port chalu karo.

00:01:07.442 --> 00:01:11.623
F1 dabavo, pachhi Settings, pachhi
Connectivity.

00:01:11.643 --> 00:01:19.986
"TallyPrime acts as" ma Both rakho. Port 9000
rakho, ane Ctrl+A dabavo.

00:01:20.006 --> 00:01:25.009
Pachhi TallyPrime bandh karo, fari kholo, ane
tamari company kholo.

00:01:25.809 --> 00:01:31.435
Have Hisaab kholo. Nava PC ma company list
khali hoy chhe.

00:01:31.465 --> 00:01:38.390
Switch from Tally select karo, ane Enter
dabavo. Hisaab tarat Tally shodhe chhe.

00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:45.867
Esc dabavo to search dekhay chhe. Hisaab e aa
PC ma ane office network ma joyu.

00:01:45.897 --> 00:01:55.473
Aa video ma test Tally port 9260 par
javab aape chhe. Tamaru TallyPrime port 9000 vapre chhe.

00:01:55.503 --> 00:02:04.842
Enter dabavo: Tally ma khulli darek company
dekhay chhe, ena GSTIN, dates ane vouchers sathe.

00:02:05.922 --> 00:02:12.265
Space thi company tick thay chhe. Enter
dabavo, ane Yes maate fari Enter.

00:02:12.295 --> 00:02:22.595
Hisaab pehla masters, pachhi vouchers, bhaage bhaage copy kare chhe.
Esc thi atke chhe, ane tyare kai save thatu nathi.

00:02:23.675 --> 00:02:28.039
Enter dabavo to Proof of Match khule chhe.
Hisaab Tally

00:02:28.059 --> 00:02:33.633
paasethi ena reports maange chhe, ane darek
line compare kare chhe.

00:02:33.663 --> 00:02:40.686
Ledger balances, stock, baaki bills, Trial
Balance, Profit & Loss ane Balance Sheet.

00:02:40.716 --> 00:02:46.541
Darek line ma Tally ni value, Hisaab ni value,
ane tick dekhay chhe.

00:02:46.571 --> 00:02:53.369
F5 thi fakt differences dekhay chhe. Ahiya ek
pan nathi, etle switch puru.

00:02:53.399 --> 00:03:03.678
Koi line ma farak hoy to Enter thi ena vouchers
dekhay chhe, ane F6 thi kaaran lakhine difference accept thay chhe.

00:03:04.658 --> 00:03:15.536
Shu aave chhe: groups ane ledgers, stock items, darek voucher
ena bills ane GST details sathe, payroll, TDS ane TCS.

00:03:15.556 --> 00:03:27.240
Shu nathi aavtu: users ane passwords, Tally add-ons, print
designs, ane juno edit log. Tamaru Tally backup sachvi rakho.

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:34.274
Thoda divas haju Tally ma bills nakho chho? To
Import ma Switch from Tally kholo.

00:03:34.573 --> 00:03:43.470
Sync again maate S dabavo. Fakt changes aave
chhe: ahiya ek navu invoice. Proof farithi chale chhe.

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:55.742
Jo Tally vala PC sathe network na hoy, to F
dabavo, ane Tally mathi Alt+E thi export kareli XML files aapo.

00:03:56.722 --> 00:04:03.860
Hisaab Tally mathi fakt vanche chhe. Tamaro
Tally data jem chhe tem j rahe chhe.

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:10.430
Saacha TallyPrime sathe pan aa j rite chale
chhe. Amara test ma

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:18.036
Tally ni sample company, 736 vouchers, aashre
12 seconds ma switch thai.

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:21.500
Chapter 4: Gateway ane keys.

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:27.290
Aa chhe Gateway of Hisaab. Tamaru kaam ahiya
thi sharu thay chhe.

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:34.810
Daabi baaju: current period, current date,
tamari company, ane eno chhello backup.

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:41.786
Jamni baaju: menu. Arrow keys vaapro, ke item
no vaadlo akshar dabavo.

00:04:41.816 --> 00:04:46.255
Upar na bar ma menus chhe, Company thi Help
sudhi.

00:04:46.285 --> 00:04:50.495
Jamni baaju no button bar darek screen ni keys
batave chhe.

00:04:51.575 --> 00:05:01.588
Alt+K thi Company menu khule chhe: company banavo,
badlo, select karo ke bandh karo. Esc thi bandh.

00:05:01.618 --> 00:05:07.524
F2 thi current date badlay chhe. Nava vouchers
aa taarikh le chhe.

00:05:07.554 --> 00:05:14.078
Ctrl+A thi accept. Have Gateway par 30 June
dekhay chhe.

00:05:15.158 --> 00:05:21.923
Alt+G etle Go To. Report na naam no thodo
bhaag lakho, jem ke "trial".

00:05:21.953 --> 00:05:28.097
Enter dabavo to tarat Trial Balance khule
chhe. Esc thi paachha.

00:05:29.177 --> 00:05:39.110
Alt+F etle SmartFind. Naam, GSTIN, number ke
rakam lakho. Thodi spelling bhool chaale.

00:05:39.140 --> 00:05:46.940
Be vaar Esc, pachhi D: Display More Reports.
Hisaab no darek report aa list ma chhe.

00:05:46.970 --> 00:05:53.812
Mouse pan chaale chhe: click karo to item
khule chhe, jem ke Balance Sheet.

00:05:53.842 --> 00:05:59.181
Pan keys vadhaare jhadpi chhe. Esc, ane tame
paachha.

00:06:00.161 --> 00:06:05.029
Aa rahi das jaruri keys. Alt+K, Company menu.

00:06:05.049 --> 00:06:10.035
Alt+F3, company select. F2, taarikh.

00:06:10.055 --> 00:06:18.965
V, vouchers. Ctrl+A, accept. Esc, paachha.
Enter, line kholo.

00:06:18.985 --> 00:06:26.666
Alt+G, koi pan report. Alt+F, shodho. Ane F1,
Help.

00:06:27.383 --> 00:06:32.533
Chapter 5: Roj nu kaam, GST ane TDS sathe.

00:06:33.332 --> 00:06:39.190
V dabavo to vouchers khule chhe. F8 etle sales
invoice.

00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:46.459
Party na naam no thodo bhaag lakho, Sharma,
ane Enter dabavo. Pachhi sales ledger.

00:06:46.489 --> 00:06:56.262
Darek item ane eni quantity lakho: 100 meter cotton
fabric, ane 10 kurta. Rate Hisaab jaate bhare chhe.

00:06:56.292 --> 00:07:06.609
CGST ane SGST select karo. Hisaab darek item
na rate parthi tax gane chhe: banne ₹790.

00:07:06.639 --> 00:07:12.934
Narration lakho, ane Enter dabavo. Hisaab
puchhe chhe: Accept?

00:07:12.964 --> 00:07:20.641
Yes maate Y. Pachhi bill-wise details: navu
bill, number 4, 30 divas ma due.

00:07:20.671 --> 00:07:24.507
End of List par Enter, ane invoice save.

00:07:26.258 --> 00:07:36.985
Page Up thi invoice fari khule chhe, ane Ctrl+P thi print
preview: GST tax invoice, HSN code ane shabdo ma rakam sathe.

00:07:37.015 --> 00:07:42.985
Ahiya thi E dabavo to PDF, M thi e-mail, ane
Alt+W thi WhatsApp.

00:07:44.065 --> 00:07:52.997
Purchase maate F9 dabavo. Supplier na invoice
no number ane taarikh, party, ane items lakho.

00:07:54.842 --> 00:08:00.347
Mehta Fabrics Maharashtra ma chhe, etle Hisaab
IGST le chhe.

00:08:00.377 --> 00:08:05.345
Narration, accept maate Y, ane bill payables
ma jaay chhe.

00:08:08.539 --> 00:08:15.811
F6 etle receipt. Bank, party, ane rakam:
₹24,080.

00:08:16.511 --> 00:08:22.001
Bill-wise: Agst Ref ma Sharma Traders na baaki
bills dekhay chhe.

00:08:22.031 --> 00:08:31.964
Invoice 4 pasand karo, narration lakho, ane Ctrl+A.
Pachhi bank details; fari Ctrl+A thi receipt save.

00:08:33.711 --> 00:08:43.426
F5 etle payment: bank, Mehta Fabrics, ane ₹63,000.
Agst Ref ma enu baaki bill dekhay chhe.

00:08:43.493 --> 00:08:51.899
Bill pasand karo, narration lakho, pachhi
Ctrl+A, bank details, ane fari Ctrl+A.

00:08:52.597 --> 00:09:00.326
F4 etle contra: ₹20,000 rokda, bank ma jama.
Ctrl+A thi save.

00:09:02.187 --> 00:09:11.098
F7 etle journal. Rent, ₹60,000, debit. Desai
Properties, credit.

00:09:11.797 --> 00:09:23.035
Hisaab TDS ni line jaate umere chhe: section
194-I hethal 10%. Makaan-maalik ne ₹54,000 male chhe.

00:09:23.065 --> 00:09:26.572
Narration, ane Ctrl+A thi save.

00:09:29.708 --> 00:09:35.515
Esc, pachhi K: Day Book ma divas na badha
vouchers dekhay chhe.

00:09:36.517 --> 00:09:41.825
Chapter 6: Reports. Enter hammesha aagal nu
level khole chhe.

00:09:42.625 --> 00:09:47.966
K dabavo to Day Book khule chhe: aaj ni
taarikh na vouchers.

00:09:47.996 --> 00:09:51.727
Koi line par Enter dabavo to voucher j khule
chhe.

00:09:52.807 --> 00:09:56.614
Esc thi paachha, ane B dabavo to Balance
Sheet.

00:09:57.315 --> 00:10:01.275
Current Assets select karo, ane Enter dabavo.

00:10:01.757 --> 00:10:06.918
Pachhi Sundry Debtors: je parties paasethi
paisa levana chhe.

00:10:06.969 --> 00:10:11.909
Party par Enter dabavo to mahine mahine
balance dekhay chhe.

00:10:11.939 --> 00:10:15.387
Mahina par Enter dabavo to ena vouchers,

00:10:15.687 --> 00:10:23.077
Ane voucher par Enter dabavo to e khule chhe.
Esc ek ek level paachhu jaay chhe.

00:10:24.826 --> 00:10:31.823
P etle Profit & Loss A/c: gross profit, ane
samaygaala nu net parinaam.

00:10:32.903 --> 00:10:38.457
S etle Stock Summary: darek group ni quantity,
rate ane value.

00:10:38.487 --> 00:10:44.904
Fabrics par Enter, pachhi Cotton Fabric par:
mahine mahine enu aavan-jaavan.

00:10:45.984 --> 00:10:54.158
Alt+G, "receivable": graahako paase baaki bills, due
date ane ketla divas modu thayu te sathe.

00:10:54.188 --> 00:11:02.465
Ctrl+E thi koi pan report Excel ke PDF ma
export thay chhe, ane Ctrl+P thi print.

00:11:02.495 --> 00:11:04.740
Esc, ane tame paachha.

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:09.779
Chapter 7: GST, TDS ane payroll.

00:11:10.579 --> 00:11:19.870
Alt+G, GSTR-1: mahina na outward supplies,
table pramane. Invoice 4 B2B ma chhe.

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:24.455
Alt+E thi GST portal maateni JSON file bane
chhe.

00:11:24.485 --> 00:11:29.478
GSTR-3B pan e j vouchers parthi bane chhe.

00:11:30.177 --> 00:11:41.560
GSTR-2B maate, portal ni file Ctrl+I thi import karo.
Hisaab darek supplier invoice tamara chopda sathe melve chhe.

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:48.525
Alt+Z, W: e-way bills. Jene e-way bill joie e
darek invoice dekhay

00:11:48.545 --> 00:11:54.624
chhe, ane pehla shu sudharvu te pan: ahiya
party no PIN code.

00:11:54.654 --> 00:12:03.126
X thi e-way bill portal maateni JSON file bane
chhe. Hisaab Services sathe, S thi online jaay chhe.

00:12:04.206 --> 00:12:13.217
Form 26Q, have Form 140, quarter no TDS bhego
kare chhe: bhaada no, ₹6,000.

00:12:13.247 --> 00:12:20.782
Alt+X thi e-TDS file bane chhe. Upload pehla
sarkaar na FVU thi chakaso.

00:12:21.862 --> 00:12:25.048
Payroll: V, pachhi Ctrl+F4.

00:12:25.748 --> 00:12:30.741
Ctrl+F thi mahina no darek karmachaari no
pagaar bharaai jaay chhe.

00:12:30.771 --> 00:12:39.007
Basic, HRA, PF ane ESI, darek karmachaari ni
salary details parthi aave chhe.

00:12:39.037 --> 00:12:42.308
Ctrl+A thi payroll voucher save.

00:12:43.009 --> 00:12:46.951
Ane pay slips taiyaar: Alt+G, "pay slip".

00:12:48.783 --> 00:12:51.611
Chapter 8: Data surakshit.

00:12:52.311 --> 00:12:59.876
Windows ma chopda Documents\Hisaab\Data ma
chhe: darek company maate ek folder.

00:12:59.896 --> 00:13:06.374
Darroj, ane darek update pehla, Hisaab darek
company no backup jaate le chhe.

00:13:07.174 --> 00:13:13.266
Alt+Y thi Data menu khule chhe. Pachhi Backup
& Restore.

00:13:13.296 --> 00:13:18.087
L etle Daily Backup. E pehla divas thi chaalu
chhe: darroj

00:13:18.107 --> 00:13:23.999
Hisaab darek company no backup le chhe ane 7
versions raakhe chhe.

00:13:24.029 --> 00:13:35.649
Aa PC parni copy, PC khovaay tyaare kaam nathi aavti.
F9 bahaar copy gothve chhe: Google Drive, OneDrive, ke folder.

00:13:36.729 --> 00:13:43.321
Hamna backup maate, e j menu ma B dabavo.
Company select thayeli chhe.

00:13:43.351 --> 00:13:48.249
Ctrl+A, pachhi Enter, ane backup tarat levaay
chhe.

00:13:48.387 --> 00:13:58.654
F8 thi backup password rakho. Pachhi file encrypted rahe
chhe: e password ke recovery key vagar nathi khulti.

00:13:59.734 --> 00:14:04.574
Hisaab Drive backups tamara potana cloud par
mokle chhe.

00:14:04.604 --> 00:14:16.321
F4 thi jagya umero: Google Drive, OneDrive, ke koi pan
synced folder. Darek backup pehla aa PC par encrypt thay chhe.

00:14:17.401 --> 00:14:26.995
R thi backup restore thay chhe, navi company tarike ke
juni ni jagyae. Kai badalta pehla Hisaab hammesha puchhe chhe.

00:14:28.075 --> 00:14:34.072
Alt+K, V: Hisaab Vault aakhi company ne
password thi encrypt kare chhe.

00:14:34.102 --> 00:14:40.744
E password surakshit jagyae rakho: koi ene
paachho nathi laavi shaktu, ame pan nahi.

00:14:41.750 --> 00:14:44.137
Chapter 10: Help ane support.

00:14:44.937 --> 00:14:54.139
Koi screen par samaj na pade? F1
dabavo: manual, keyboard shortcuts, settings ane Hisaab Services.

00:14:54.169 --> 00:14:59.544
Fari F1 dabavo to je screen par chho enu
manual page khule chhe.

00:15:00.624 --> 00:15:06.492
Ctrl+K thi screen ni bhasha badlay chhe:
Hindi, Gujarati ane biji.

00:15:06.522 --> 00:15:13.830
Aa rahyo Gujarati ma Gateway. Keys e j rahe
chhe, ane tamaro data badlaato nathi.

00:15:13.860 --> 00:15:17.260
Fari Ctrl+K, ane English paachhu.

00:15:19.009 --> 00:15:24.831
F1, V: Hisaab Services darek online service
batave chhe, jem ke Connected

00:15:24.851 --> 00:15:30.361
GST, e-invoice ane Hisaab Drive, ane kai set
thayeli chhe te pan.

00:15:31.341 --> 00:15:35.749
Dar vakhte kholo tyare Hisaab navu version
tapaase chhe.

00:15:35.769 --> 00:15:43.572
F1, Upgrade thi install thay chhe. Hisaab
pehla darek company no backup le chhe.

00:15:44.271 --> 00:15:49.207
Koi savaal? info@nexertechnology.com par
lakho.

00:15:49.227 --> 00:15:56.761
Pehla demo company par practice karo, pachhi
tamara chopda laavo. Hisaab ma swaagat chhe.

